      "text": "\n$k \\geq 1 / 2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "wybnG",
      "text": "\n$-1 / 2 \\leq k \\leq 1 / 2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "awsQr",
      "text": "\n$k \\leq 1 / 2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of circle $(x-h)^2+(y-k)^2=k^2$ \nIt is passing through $(-1,1)$ then\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& (-1-h)^2+(1-k)^2=k^2 \\\\\n& h^2+2 h-2 k+2=0 \\\\\n& D \\geq 0 \\\\\n& 2 k-1 \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow k \\geq 1 / 2.\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
